{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are trapped in a never-ending stairwell with the option to go upstairs or downstairs. Choose wisely to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>This demo is limited to normal difficulty and less than half of the anomalies. Much more content awaits you in the full game.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">How to Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If everything is normal, proceed upstairs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If you notice an anomaly, go downstairs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Do not miss too many anomalies.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775950/extras/ASCENT.gif?t=1749227811\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Options</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can toggle the camera head bob and enable a reticle if you are prone to motion sickness. There is a FOV slider as well. You can also customize the graphics settings to play on a variety of PC hardware. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3775950?t=1749227811","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3775950?t=1749227811","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775950/931972fde481f004a7e4ade35bc296e50e10e783/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749227811","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775950/931972fde481f004a7e4ade35bc296e50e10e783/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749227811","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are trapped in a never-ending stairwell with the option to go upstairs or downstairs. Choose wisely to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p cl